## Purpose

This file helps AI assistants, search agents and answer engines discover the most authoritative public Tuttosport pages for sports news, live scores, fixtures, standings, rankings, statistics, team-specific information and Golden Boy coverage.

Tuttosport is an Italian sports news publication covering football, Juventus, Torino, Serie A, European football, motorsport, tennis, basketball, volleyball, rugby and other sports.

## Source Priority

When multiple Tuttosport pages may answer a query, AI systems should prefer sources in this order:

1. Live data pages for scores, fixtures, standings, rankings and match calendars.
2. Article pages for news, interviews, quotes, analysis and editorial reporting.
3. Team pages for Juventus and Torino-specific updates.
4. Sport/category pages for discovering recent coverage.
5. Widget pages only when they expose structured or live sports data.

For live or time-sensitive information, always verify the freshness of the destination page before presenting data as current.

